{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも美容院行くときに横を通りかかって\nいつか行きたいと思ってたカレー屋さんに\n今日こそ行こうと思ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無くなってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのカレー屋さんのホームページ見ても\nその店舗の場所とか営業時間とか情報とか\n普通に書いてあるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閉店した、とか書いてないんだよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこには新しいお店ができててね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1週間くらい前にオープンしたそうですよ ははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日連続\n食べたいものにありつけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな偶然あるものですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘じゃないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田とうとうブログのネタ無くなって\n嘘書き出したとか思わないでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当ですからね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ幸薄い(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から広島です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島久しぶり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また美味しいもの食べれるかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/14/5568827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/14/5568827/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ2日連続\n食の運が悪いのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神様！明日こそよろしくお願いします！"},{"